# Photo pipeline output — regenerated by `npm run photo` (predev/prebuild).
# Generated images are not committed (sharp runs in prebuild everywhere).
# photo-meta.json IS committed: it is byte-stable (no timestamp) and must
# exist for `npm run typecheck`, which imports it before prebuild runs.
